1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,000
Water shapes a farm and a mountainside
in very different ways.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:10,500
But understanding change begins with seeing it.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:17,000
RHD Labs imagines NISAR radar, small data windows,
and a shared globe working together.

4
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:24,000
Our Saskatchewan and British Columbia examples are simulated,
showing how a future workflow could make complex observations easier to discuss.

5
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:29,200
Open the data story, inspect the evidence,
and keep uncertainty in view.

